        "spans_beyond_this_verse": false,
        "translator": "K. M. K. Murthy / Desiraju Hanumanta Rao",
        "text": "She that prosperous city Ayodhya is muchly crammed with many a eulogist and panegyrist, yet she is highly splendorous with many a bastion, flag and hundreds of batteries of canons, and Dasharatha dwells therein. [1-5-11]"
      }
    ],
